<div class="page-intro prose">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p class="lede">Short version: no cookies, no personal data, no cross-site tracking.</p>
</div>

<div class="prose">
  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>This site uses <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare Web Analytics</a>, a privacy-friendly, cookieless analytics service. It records aggregate information, such as how many people viewed a page and which site they came from. It sets no cookies and stores nothing on your device. It builds no profile of you, and it does not follow you to other websites.</p>

  <h2>What this site does not do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No cookies, so no cookie banner.</li>
    <li>No advertising, and no sharing or selling of data.</li>
    <li>No accounts, logins, or forms that collect personal information.</li>
    <li>No tracking of individuals across this or any other site.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>The data shown on this site</h2>
  <p>The figures here come from official public sources (ONS, OBR, the Debt Management Office, HM Treasury, and the IMF). See the <a href="{{ '/sources/' | url }}">sources page</a> for details. This is an independent educational project, not an official government service.</p>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>Netlify hosts the site. Like any host, it may process standard server request logs, including your IP address, to deliver pages and block abuse.</p>
</div>
